# A challenge header is the WAF talking: challenge wins over the status code.
# Two independent signatures (the header and the body marker) raise confidence.
# expect: blocked
# confidence: high
# reason-contains: challenge
--- request
GET / HTTP/1.1
Host: example.com
--- response
HTTP/1.1 403 Forbidden
cf-mitigated: challenge
content-type: text/html

<html><body>Checking your browser before accessing.</body></html>
